      "PROPOSED_FIX": "FIND: `bench/immune_agents.py`, function `_verify_ct_claim()` and caller `cytotoxic_t_cell()`.\nFIX: validate against the explicit allowed file set, not parent directories.\n\nFirst replace `_verify_ct_claim` signature and containment block:\n<<<<\ndef _verify_ct_claim(\n    evidence: Dict[str, Any],\n    allowed_dirs: Optional[List[str]] = None,\n) -> Tuple[bool, float, str]:\n>>>>\n====\ndef _verify_ct_claim(\n    evidence: Dict[str, Any],\n    allowed_paths: Optional[List[str]] = None,\n) -> Tuple[bool, float, str]:\n>>>>\n\n<<<<\n    real_path = os.path.realpath(file_path)\n    if allowed_dirs:\n        in_allowed = any(\n            real_path.startswith(os.path.realpath(d) + os.sep) or real_path == os.path.realpath(d)\n            for d in allowed_dirs\n        )\n        if not in_allowed:\n            return False, 0.0, \"Path outside allowed source directories\"\n>>>>\n====\n    real_path = os.path.realpath(file_path)\n    if allowed_paths:\n        allowed_realpaths = {\n            os.path.realpath(str(p)) for p in allowed_paths\n        }\n        if real_path not in allowed_realpaths:\n            return False, 0.0, \"Path outside allowed source files\"\n>>>>\n\nThen replace `_ct_evidence_to_verdict` parameter and callsite:\n<<<<\ndef _ct_evidence_to_verdict(\n    finding_id: str,\n    claim_type: str,\n    evidence_items: List[Dict[str, Any]],\n    allowed_dirs: Optional[List[str]] = None,\n) -> CellVerdict:\n>>>>\n====\ndef _ct_evidence_to_verdict(\n    finding_id: str,\n    claim_type: str,\n    evidence_items: List[Dict[str, Any]],\n    allowed_paths: Optional[List[str]] = None,\n) -> CellVerdict:\n>>>>\n\n<<<<\n        verified, conf, reason = _verify_ct_claim(ev, allowed_dirs=allowed_dirs)\n>>>>\n====\n        verified, conf, reason = _verify_ct_claim(ev, allowed_paths=allowed_paths)\n>>>>\n\n<<<<\n            # C5-01: pass source_paths as allowed_dirs for path traversal protection\n            allowed_dirs = [os.path.dirname