      "ABSTRACTION_INDEX": 0.52,
      "DESCRIPTION": "Formalisation-agent precondition extraction misses negative and scientific-notation bounds, causing systematic under-detection of contextual constraints. In `bench/immune_agents.py`, `_PRECONDITION_PATTERNS` only includes terminal numeric forms like `\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?` and single-letter variables. Evidence: examples such as `x >= -1`, `p < 1e-5`, or `threshold <= -0.25` are valid preconditions under the module's own math/logical scope, but they do not match the third pattern and often fail the first because of punctuation constraints. This undermines the shadow agent's stated purpose of detecting false rejections due to lost preconditions.",
      "PROPOSED_FIX": "FIND: `bench/immune_agents.py`, `_PRECONDITION_PATTERNS`, numeric grammar omits signs and exponents.\n\nFIX:\n<<<<\n_PRECONDITION_PATTERNS = [\n    re.compile(r'(?:for\\s+all|for\\s+every|when|where|if|given\\s+that|assuming)\\s+([^,;.]+(?:[<>=!]+)[^,;.]+)', re.IGNORECASE),\n    re.compile(r'(?:with|under)\\s+(?:the\\s+)?(?:constraint|condition|assumption)\\s+(?:that\\s+)?([^,;.]+)', re.IGNORECASE),\n    re.compile(r'(\\b[a-z]\\s*[><=!]+\\s*\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)', re.IGNORECASE),\n]\n====\n_NUMERIC_PRECOND = r'[-+]?\\d*\\.?\\d+(?:[eE][-+]?\\d+)?'\n_PRECONDITION_PATTERNS = [\n    re.compile(r'(?:for\\s+all|for\\s+every|when|where|if|given\\s+that|assuming)\\s+([^,;.]+(?:[<>=!]+)[^,;.]+)', re.IGNORECASE),\n    re.compile(r'(?:with|under)\\s+(?:the\\s+)?(?:constraint|condition|assumption)\\s+(?:that\\s+)?([^,;.]+)', re.IGNORECASE),\n    re.compile(r'(\\b[a-z]\\s*[><=!]+\\s*' + _NUMERIC_PRECOND + r')', re.IGNORECASE),\n]\n>>>>\n\nFOLLOW: This expands only the shadow formalisation path, but it affects `formalisation_agent_shadow()` counts (`preconditions_found`, `z3_translatable`, `potential_false_rejection`) and therefore any analysis comparing B-cell error modes across runs. `_preconditions_to_z3()` must also be able to translate the newly extracted strings; today it can pass signed/scientific numeric literals through unchanged, so no additional code change is required there."
