    filtered = [tf.finding for tf in triaged]
    rejected = []
```
This occurs after reconciliation gate (lines 2831-2835) which produced `final_verdicts` with locked REJECTED verdicts. The override ignores the locked verdicts.

**FIX:** Modify the autoimmune override to respect reconciliation-locked REJECTED verdicts. Only override verdicts that are not locked (i.e., not REJECTED by both v1 and v2).
```python
